I thought I'd already done away with my mementos from the\npast.%K%P
我明明把回忆之物都整理过了的…%K%P
But I found a nostalgic and painful shard of my memories\ninconspicuously hiding in one of my bag's inner pockets.%K%P
这是我漫不经心地夹在皮包里的，\n那令人怀念而又痛彻心扉的记忆碎片。%K%P
%LCOsamu
%LC理
\dAsami rented a dress and a car on the day of our\ngraduation, and we went straight to the Karuizawa Church\nto have a ceremony. The only guests were the few friends\nwho could fit into the car.\d%K%P
「麻实毕业的那天，她去租了一套婚纱，\n然后我们就那样坐着租来的车到了轻井泽的一个教堂，举行了婚礼。\n来宾也只有在车上一起过来的几个朋友…」%K%P
%LCMitoko
%LC美都子
\dWhoa... You thought you were being cool, weren't you?\d%K%P
