I was just as weak-willed back then, with my most\noutstanding trait being my height. Not to mention I\ncouldn't even eat rice. Still...%K%P
那个时候的我，实在是个软弱的家伙啊。\n除了个子很高，其它任何长处都没有。\n而且从小时候起就无法吃米饭。%K%P
I managed to secure myself the mundane happiness of the\naverage man, finding a woman who would've otherwise been\ncompletely out of my league.%K%P
即使如此，我还是获得了平常人的生活，\n得到了一位自己原本配不上的女性。%K%P
...That picture might just have been taken during the\nhappiest moment of my life.%K%P
…那也许是我人生的巅峰了吧。%K%P
