「那，要提拉米苏和意大利冰淇淋。\n我去饮料台弄点饮料去」%K%P
%LCOsamu
%LC理
\d...You're not worried about your weight?\d%K%P
「…不会发胖么？」%K%P
%LCAsami
%LC麻实
\dWhat are you talking about?\nThat tiramisu is yours, isn't it?\d%K%P
「说什么呢。\n提拉米苏是给你点的」%K%P
%LCOsamu
%LC理
\d...\d%K%P
「………」%K%P
%LCAsami
%LC麻实
\dAnyway, I'll be back in a bit.\nYou're okay with espresso, right?\d%K%P
「那我先过去了。\n热咖啡的话是要用Ｓ号ＰＲＥＳＳＯ杯对吧？」%K%P
%LCOsamu
%LC理
\d...\d%K%P
「………」%K%P
With all my words said for me, the only way I could still\ndeclare my existence was by pushing the button to call the\nwaiter.%K%P
轻而易举就被她的话噎住了的我，\n除了一直按桌子上的呼叫服务按钮以外，\n就没有别的方法来彰显自己的存在了…%K%P
I wish I could have retorted with something cool like \dI'm\nin the mood for parfait today,\d but I really did want that\ntiramisu.%K%P
虽然『今天我想吃布丁圣代！』\n说出这样的反驳之辞会显得很帅气，\n不过扪心自问，我的确只想吃提拉米苏罢了。  %K%P
...Hm, maybe that retort wasn't as cool as I thought.%K%P
…倒不如说那样的反驳完全不帅气。%K%P
%LCClerk
%LC店员
\dHow can I help you, sir?\d%K%P
「久等了」%K%P
%LCOsamu
%LC理
\dA gelato and a slice of tiramisu, please.\n...And another glass of red wine.\d%K%P
「意大利冰淇淋和提拉米苏。\n…还有，再来一杯葡萄酒。要红葡萄酒…这个」%K%P
As such, I decided to retort by making her orders for her.%K%P
所以反击就用点单来对抗了。%K%P
...%K%P
………%K%P
%LCClerk
%LC店员
\dAnd the wine will be for...?\d%K%P
「喝酒的客人是？」%K%P
%LCOsamu
%LC理
\dHer.\d%K%P
「她」%K%P
%LCAsami
%LC麻实
\d...\d%K%P
「………」%K%P
I remembered how she kept going on about gelato being\nperfect with red wine for some reason.%K%P
低度数的红葡萄酒，\n是最适合意大利冰淇淋的。这种喜好真是莫名其妙啊。%K%P
...%K%P
………%K%P
%LCAsami
%LC麻实
\dPhew...\d%K%P
「呼…」%K%P
%LCOsamu
%LC理
\dWhy are you looking at me like that...?\d%K%P
「你这眼神是什么意思啊…」%K%P
%LCAsami
%LC麻实
\dOh, I was just wondering when you learned how to treat a\nwoman.\d%K%P
「我是在想，你什么时候\n变得这么会照顾女性了啊～？」%K%P
%LCOsamu
%LC理
\dIt's not like that. Besides, any normal girl would find\nthis combination of flavors preposterous.\d%K%P
「才不是这样啊。\n再说，如此恶趣味的搭配，\n如果是别的女孩，早就吓跑了吧」%K%P
%LCAsami
%LC麻实
\dYou think? I'd say it's pretty good.\d%K%P
「是么？\n很好吃的哦？」%K%P
She took a sip of wine after swallowing a spoonful of\ngelato.%K%P
她把意大利冰淇淋送到嘴里后，\n立即喝一口葡萄酒…%K%P
It was still very much incomprehensible to me.%K%P
真是我无法理解的世界。%K%P
%LCAsami
%LC麻实
\dBesides, you're in no position to talk when you're the\none scraping the cocoa powder off your tiramisu.\d%K%P
「倒是你啊…\n从刚才起就一直只拿可可粉，这是要干什么？」%K%P
%LCOsamu
%LC理
\dI'd prefer not to have any trace of bitterness in it,\nthank you very much...\d%K%P
「提拉米苏怎么能做成苦味的呢…」%K%P
If I wanted sweet, I'd have a zabaione. If I wanted\nbitter, I'd have an espresso.%K%P
甜的是萨白利昂。\n苦的是意式咖啡。\n※译注：萨白利昂，一种用葡萄酒、鸡蛋、白糖调制而成的意大利甜点。%K%P
%LCAsami
%LC麻实
\dYou always kept eating it like that, no matter what I\ntold you.\d%K%P
「说了多少遍了，\n叫你别再那样吃了」%K%P
%LCOsamu
%LC理
\dWell, at least I'm not the one who eats toast with\nseaweed!\d%K%P
「麻、麻实你才是…就着海苔吃烤肉」%K%P
%LCAsami
%LC麻实
\dYou still break your croissants apart and eat each little\npart of them separately, right?\d%K%P
「你吃牛角面包的时候，\n肯定是沿着纤维的方向吃得乱七八糟的吧？」%K%P
%LCOsamu
%LC理
\dWell, you're the one who always kept hogging the baguette\nends to yourself.\d%K%P
「你吃长面包的时候，\n绝对不会把硬的那一头让给我」%K%P
%LCAsami
%LC麻实
\dYou're the one who always kept swirling your mug around\nwhile you drank cocoa.\d%K%P
「你总是会一边晃着杯子一边喝可可」%K%P
%LCOsamu
%LC理
\dI'd get more residue at the bottom if I didn't. Besides,\nwhat's with you and putting tabasco sauce on Hamburg\nsteak, anyway?\d%K%P
「不晃的话杯底就会留下一些啊。\n别说我了，你倒是别在汉堡包上抹辣酱啊」%K%P
%LCAsami
%LC麻实
\dWell, I've had doubts about your sanity since I saw you\nputting tabasco on shaved ice.\d%K%P
「你往刨冰上抹辣酱的时候，\n我都怀疑你神志不清了哦？」%K%P
%LCOsamu
%LC理
\dSeriously, there's an actual restaurant that does that!\nIn Nagoya, though.\d%K%P
「那该怪罪果真那么卖的那家店啊！\n虽说在名古屋就是了」%K%P
%LCAsami
%LC麻实
\d...\d%K%P
「………」%K%P
%LCOsamu
%LC理
\d...\d%K%P
「………」%K%P
%LCAsami
%LC麻实
\d...Pwh.\d%K%P
「…噗」%K%P
%LCOsamu
%LC理
\dAh... Ahah... Ahaha...\d%K%P
「啊、啊哈、啊哈哈…」%K%P
%LCAsami
%LC麻实
\dHahahahaha... Ahahaha...\nWe both have some pretty weird habits, don't we?\d%K%P
「呵呵呵呵呵…啊哈哈哈…\n真是恶趣味啊～，我们两个」%K%P
Although our unusual propensities surprised us at the\nbeginning, we eventually got used to and understood -- if\nnot exactly embraced -- them.%K%P
刚开始那些让人吃惊得莫名其妙的习惯，\n不知不觉就习以为常了。虽然不能理解可还是接受了下来，\n变成生活里理所当然的事情。%K%P
%LCOsamu
%LC理
\dAhaha... I'm surprised we can still remember all this.\d%K%P
「啊哈哈…而且，我们彼此都记得很清楚啊」%K%P
%LCAsami
%LC麻实
\dIt's not something you forget that easily. I mean, it's\nbeen eight years since we met, right?\d%K%P
「怎么可能这么简单就忘了。\n距离我们最初的相遇也不过才八年吧？」%K%P
%LCOsamu
%LC理
\dSo it's already been that long, huh...\d%K%P
「时间可真快啊…」%K%P
A somewhat gloomy university student in his third year,\nand a freshman that slightly lacked strength of character.%K%P
有些消极的大学三年级学生，\n和没什么主见的新生。%K%P
We had many vivid memories of our first six years spent\ntogether, as well as the two years of our marriage.%K%P
我们认识之后的六年时间。\n还有结婚之后的两年时间。\n绝不是没有留下回忆的。%K%P
%LCAsami
%LC麻实
\dWe fought quite a lot, didn't we?\d%K%P
「我们也吵过不少架呢」%K%P
%LCOsamu
%LC理
\dUsually you're about as indecisive as me, but then you\nnever back down on certain other things.\d%K%P
「你明明平时没什么主见，\n可最后的最后倒是一点也没退让啊」%K%P
%LCAsami
%LC麻实
\dYeah, like you're one to talk... You keep apologizing to\npretty much everyone, but then once in a blue moon, you\nbecome overly forceful and assertive.\d%K%P
「你平常明明是一个劲一个劲地道歉，\n可偶尔像是打开了开关一样，变得强硬得不像你了」%K%P
We both lacked initiative, but...%K%P
我们两人都说不上非常积极就是了…%K%P
...the more time we spent together, the more fights we\nhad. We really didn't have a shortage of those.%K%P
因为在一起的时间飞跃性地增长，\n就算发生率不变，发生次数也会飞跃性增长，\n我们就这样一直反复发生矛盾。%K%P
...Well, except for that final week.%K%P
…去掉最后一个星期。%K%P
%LCOsamu
%LC理
\dIt was... kinda fun...\d%K%P
「也算是挺开心的…」%K%P
%LCAsami
%LC麻实
\dJust -kinda-...?\d%K%P
「算是…？」%K%P
%LCOsamu
%LC理
\dYeah, kinda.\nHow about you?\d%K%P
「嗯，算是。\n麻实呢？」%K%P
%LCAsami
%LC麻实
\d...It wasn't bad, I suppose.\d%K%P
「………还行，吧？」%K%P
%LCOsamu
%LC理
\dIt wasn't bad, huh.\d%K%P
「还行…么」%K%P
%LCAsami
%LC麻实
\dThat's the kind of people we are.\d%K%P
「我们两个，一直都是这样的」%K%P
%LCOsamu
%LC理
\dYeah, that's as far it goes.\d%K%P
「嗯，就是那种程度吧」%K%P
%LCAsami
%LC麻实
\d...\d%K%P
「………」%K%P
%LCOsamu
%LC理
\d...\d%K%P
「………」%K%P
After all, if we admitted them to be our greatest\nmemories, it would call our entire decision to split into\nquestion.%K%P
因为，要是想起来太多开心的往事，\n就会否定我们当初的决断。%K%P
If we unconditionally acknowledged the two years before\nour divorce, we would be denying the two years after it.%K%P
将结婚那两年的事情全部肯定的话，\n就是将离婚这两年的事情全部否定了。%K%P
As such, we had to both admit that it was fun to be\ntogether once, but also believe that our life was just as\ngood right now -- that we did not make a mistake.%K%P
所以我们两个人相处的时候“算是”很开心，\n但却不能不相信自己现在是正确的。%K%P
...%K%P
………%K%P
%LCOsamu
%LC理
\dBy the way...\d%K%P
「说起来…」%K%P
%LCAsami
%LC麻实
\dHow is Mitoko doing lately?\d%K%P
「美都子，怎么样了？」%K%P
%LCOsamu
%LC理
\dEh? O-Oh...\d%K%P
「诶？啊、啊啊…」%K%P
After leaving the restaurant, hopping on the train for two\nstops, then walking for about ten minutes...%K%P
从店里出来，坐了两站电车，\n然后步行１０分钟左右…%K%P
...I finally mustered the courage to ask her about how\nthat thing she wanted my advice for went down.%K%P
我好不容易找到一个时机，\n鼓起勇气准备开口问『那件事的经过』的瞬间。%K%P
However, my words froze in my mouth before I could utter\nthem.%K%P
刚要从我嘴里说出『求婚』这个单词的时候，\n她就漂亮地终止了我的话。%K%P
%LCOsamu
%LC理
\dShe's studying like crazy these days.\nI'm sure we can feel confident about that scholarship.\d%K%P
「非常拼命地在学习。\n就像是得到了奖学金似的」%K%P
%LCAsami
%LC麻实
\dI see... so she still uses studying as an excuse to\nvent.\d%K%P
「这样啊…她现在仍旧保持着学习的动力啊」%K%P
%LCOsamu
%LC理
\dShe has a big goal right now.\nI don't think she has time for stress.\d%K%P
「因为有目标啊。\n而且我觉得她也没感到多少压力」%K%P
%LCAsami
%LC麻实
\dYou certainly are laidback about this.\d%K%P
「…你还真是从容不迫啊」%K%P
%LCOsamu
%LC理
\dWhy do you keep making it sound like I should be worried?\nI thought teachers were supposed to be more positive than\nthat.\d%K%P
「别把你在意的事情一件一件说出来啊。\n明明是班主任，对她的事情这么消极是几个意思啊？」%K%P
During the conference, Asami fully supported our choice to\ngo for that difficult scholarship, yet now she avoided my\neyes and shifted her gaze toward the stars littered about\nin the dark sky.%K%P
在座谈会的时候，麻实明明还赞成都子去参加特招考试，\n事到如今她的视线，却像是躲开我的追问一样，\n被夜空的星星吸引走了。%K%P
%LCAsami
%LC麻实
\dListen, Osamu...\d%K%P
「呐，理…」%K%P
%LCOsamu
%LC理
\dToko will succeed. There's no way the world is cruel\nenough to ignore all the effort she's putting into this.\d%K%P
「都子肯定会合格的。\n这么努力的孩子都不能得到回报的话，\n如此残酷的世界，谁能受得了」%K%P
%LCAsami
%LC麻实
\dWhat are you planning to do about her from now on?\d%K%P
「那孩子的事情，以后怎么办？」%K%P
%LCOsamu
%LC理
\dHuh...? Well, that should be obvious. I'll look after her\nuntil she grows up and can look after herself.\d%K%P
「怎么办…，那还用说吗。\n直到都子进入社会，能够不依靠别人的力量\n生活下去之前，我会一直在那孩子身边…」%K%P
%LCAsami
%LC麻实
\dThat's only in case her mother never comes back, isn't\nit?\d%K%P
「她的母亲一直不回来的情况下你才会那样做吧？」%K%P
%LCOsamu
%LC理
\dYes. I'll be there for her, so that even in the worst\ncase--\d%K%P
「所以即使遇到最坏的情况，我也要让都子好好的…」%K%P
%LCAsami
%LC麻实
\dWhat if her mother does come back?\nWhat if she swears to never leave her again?\d%K%P
「要是她母亲回来了呢？\n好好地反省，发誓再不会擅自离开家的话呢？」%K%P
%LCOsamu
%LC理
\d...Eh?\d%K%P
「…诶？」%K%P
%LCAsami
%LC麻实
\dWhat if the girl you're so worried about is able to\nreturn to the kind of life where she doesn't need to rely\non your help?\d%K%P
「如果你一直关心着的美都子，\n即使不依靠你，也能幸福地生活下去呢？」%K%P
%LCOsamu
%LC理
\dEh? Eh...?\d%K%P
「诶、诶…？」%K%P
%LCAsami
%LC麻实
\dWhat will you do then?\d%K%P
「那个时候…你怎么办？」%K%P
%LCOsamu
%LC理
\dIf Toko...\d%K%P
「都子她…？」%K%P
%LCAsami
%LC麻实
\dHave you considered it?\nThe possibility of an unexpected stroke of good luck on\nher part?\d%K%P
「好好考虑过了么？\n『意料之外的幸福』降临后的事情」%K%P
%LCOsamu
%LC理
\dIf I was no longer needed...?\d%K%P
「就算我不在…？」%K%P
Of course... I thought about it.%K%P
当然考虑过啊。\n而且是一直在考虑。%K%P
Toko's beloved mother... A future in which the person who\nonce saved me would come back to fix this whole mess.%K%P
都子最喜欢的妈妈…\n就算程度小也算是拯救了我的那个人，\n为了都子将一切重新来过，那种情况下的未来。%K%P
%LCOsamu
%LC理
\dHuh...?\d%K%P
「诶…？」%K%P
Yet before I knew it... I stopped even thinking about the\npossibility of a future like that.%K%P
可是现在…\n对于那个如此理想的未来，\n我却不愿意去想了。%K%P
When did that happen...? When did I begin to avert my eyes\nfrom what was obviously the best possible outcome for her?%K%P
是什么时候开始的呢？\n我是什么时候把那个理所当然的最好选择排除在外了呢？%K%P
The ideal future for Toko.%K%P
什么时候不愿意去思考那个对都子来说理想的未来了呢？%K%P
%LCAsami
%LC麻实
\dShould've guessed it.\d%K%P
「果然啊」%K%P
%LCOsamu
%LC理
\dGuessed what...?\d%K%P
「什么啊…」%K%P
%LCAsami
%LC麻实
\dWe're here. I stay at Room #203.\d%K%P
「到咯。\n这里的２０３号房」%K%P
%LCOsamu
%LC理
\dAh...\d%K%P
「啊…」%K%P
Before I realized it, we had left the clamor of the city\nand were in a residential area.%K%P
我们不知不觉就离开了繁华的大路，进入了住宅街。%K%P
I was standing at the entrance of the relatively small but\nwell-kept two-storey apartment.%K%P
在虽然不大但小巧精致的二层建筑公寓入口处，\n我们停了下来。%K%P
%LCAsami
%LC麻实
\dThis was your first time seeing me home, right?\d%K%P
「你这还是第一次送我回家吧？」%K%P
%LCOsamu
%LC理
\dY-Yeah...\d%K%P
「啊，嗯…」%K%P
We would normally go our separate ways at the station.%K%P
平常总是在车站前就挥手告别了。%K%P
And on the few occasions we had to take the same train, I\nwould only accompany her up to the street itself, at which\npoint she told me I could go home.%K%P
就算偶尔回去的电车方向相同，\n也会说『到这里就好』来送别。%K%P
%LCAsami
%LC麻实
\dAre you tired?\nI made you walk quite a bit.\d%K%P
「累了吧？\n走了这么远」%K%P
%LCOsamu
%LC理
\dN-No... not at all.\d%K%P
「不，不会…完全不会」%K%P
I forgot the time.%K%P
因为，忘了时间。%K%P
For some reason, I boarded the same train as her, even\nthough I could've gotten back home perfectly fine on foot.%K%P
只有今天，\n本应该步行回家的我，非常自然地登上了电车。%K%P
Asami never stopped me this time around.%K%P
麻实一直没有说『到这里就可以了』。%K%P
And...%K%P
然后…%K%P
%LCAsami
%LC麻实
\dW-Would you like... some tea?\d%K%P
「上、上去…喝一杯茶如何？」%K%P
%LCOsamu
%LC理
\dEh...?\d%K%P
「诶…？」%K%P
Perhaps it was just my ears playing tricks on me, but her\nwords felt rehearsed, despite the otherwise natural\nsituation.%K%P
麻实的那句话，\n极力『装作』让人听起来很自然，\n大概也只限于今天吧。%K%P
%LCAsami
%LC麻实
\dAh, um... I didn't mean anything by it.\nI just thought it's grown pretty cold by now, so I\nfigured...\d%K%P
「啊～，额…\n这没什么大不了的，对吧？\n因为你看，现在天也冷起来了，那个…」%K%P
%LCOsamu
%LC理
\dY-Yeah...\d%K%P
「唔，嗯」%K%P
And if that wasn't enough, it felt as though she was\ngetting flustered, almost like...%K%P
然而她的话非但没有听起来很自然，\n反而是漏洞百出…%K%P
%LCAsami
%LC麻实
\dI mean, you don't have work tomorrow, right?\d%K%P
「因为，理你明天休息吧？」%K%P
%LCOsamu
%LC理
\dEh...?\d%K%P
「诶…？」%K%P
%LCAsami
%LC麻实
\dAh! ...I didn't mean you should stay until then!\nI'll have you leave after you drink your tea and warm up,\nokay?\d%K%P
「啊…！？\n…就、就是说，我看你挺悠闲的。\n只是喝杯茶，然后马上就回去好么？」%K%P
%LCOsamu
%LC理
\d...\d%K%P
「………」%K%P
What was the necessity of going in, then?%K%P
既然如此，那也没必要特意上去吧…%K%P
%LCAsami
%LC麻实
\dOr... I'll leave that decision to you.\d%K%P
「………啊，要怎么样就交给你来判断了」%K%P
%LCOsamu
%LC理
\dH-Hey...\d%K%P
「喂、喂…」%K%P
What was going on?\nIt felt almost like she had returned to five years ago...%K%P
